  "normalized": "Sales to MMC, PTFI’s joint venture partner in PT Smelting, totaled $1.7 billion in 2025, $4.4 billion in 2024 and $2.0 billion in 2023. Sales to MMC totaled 17% of FCX’s consolidated revenues in 2024, and they are the only customer that accounted for 10% or more of FCX’s annual consolidated revenues during the three years ended December 31, 2025.",
